{"id":1894,"date":"2026-08-25T17:33:24","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:33:24","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1894"},"modified":"2026-08-25T17:45:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T17:45:37","slug":"the-design-checker","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/accessibility\/the-design-checker\/","title":{"rendered":"The Design Checker"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Design Checker<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1912\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker.webp\" alt=\"The Design Checker\" width=\"128\" height=\"152\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker.webp 808w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker-253x300.webp 253w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheDesignChecker-768x911.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Design Checker is a pre-flight diagnostic tool that scans your document for potential problems before you print or share it. Running it before every export is a good habit &#8211; it catches issues that are easy to miss visually but that can significantly affect the quality of your printed or shared output.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Running the Design Checker<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1900\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-183230.png\" alt=\"Document Info GUI containing the design Checker\" width=\"478\" height=\"472\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-183230.png 1057w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-183230-300x296.png 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-183230-1024x1011.png 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Screenshot-2026-08-25-183230-768x759.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 478px) 100vw, 478px\" \/><\/h3>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Go to <strong>File &gt; Info &gt; Run Design Checker<\/strong>.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">A report is generated listing all flagged issues found across your document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What It Checks<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Text Overflow &#8211;<\/strong> Text boxes where typed content exceeds the visible box boundary. Any text beyond the boundary would be cut off in the final output without any visible warning on screen.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Low-Resolution Images &#8211;<\/strong> Images that have been stretched beyond their native pixel dimensions, flagged as a pixelation risk when printed. What looks acceptable on screen can appear blurry or blocky in physical print.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Off-Page Objects &#8211;<\/strong> Elements that are partially or completely outside the page boundary and would be clipped or absent from the exported or printed output.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Navigating to Issues<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1909\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NavigatingToIssues.webp\" alt=\"Navigating to Issues\" width=\"128\" height=\"145\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NavigatingToIssues.webp 399w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NavigatingToIssues-265x300.webp 265w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Each flagged issue in the report has a <strong>crosshair button<\/strong>. Clicking it closes the report, scrolls directly to the problem element, selects it, and flashes a red highlight around it &#8211; so you can locate and fix the issue immediately without having to search for it manually.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Design Checker The Design Checker is a pre-flight diagnostic tool that scans your document for potential problems before you print or share it. Running it before every export is a good habit &#8211; it catches issues that are easy to miss visually but that can significantly affect the quality of your printed or shared [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1912,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[23],"class_list":["post-1894","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-accessibility"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1894","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1894"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1894\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1914,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1894\/revisions\/1914"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1912"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1894"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1894"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}